# Streamlit secrets template.
#
# The v2 baseline pipeline does not require any secrets — all data sources
# (Statistics Estonia PXWeb, Anthropic Economic Index on Hugging Face,
# Felten AIOE on GitHub) are public.
#
# If a future model variant needs an API key (e.g. for a paid AEI tier or
# a scheduled re-fetch), copy this file to secrets.toml and add the key:
#
#     ANTHROPIC_API_KEY = "sk-ant-..."
#
# Then read it in src/dashboard.py or elsewhere as:
#
#     import streamlit as st
#     api_key = st.secrets["ANTHROPIC_API_KEY"]
#
# secrets.toml is gitignored. On Streamlit Community Cloud, add secrets via
# the app's "Secrets" settings panel (not committed to the repo).
